        "created_at": "2017-02-09T13:24:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>When in the Travel Phase Actions Event, the IND Frigate no ships may leave this sector this phase, but the mission An Explosive Plan moves the SF ships. Does the frigate take priority and the mission moves without the ships, or does the mission take priority and move the ships with it?</p><p>I think the frigate overrides all movement, but I wanted to get some other opinions.</p>",
