        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/91b2a8/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-02-10T15:58:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yes, but it could be argued that the mission's phase event triggers before the frigate's because it is an event and not a static status, more so because I had just read a forum discussion that said players choose the order the events occur in. I had adjusted my game board before noting the frigate ability and then had to undo it. Not a big deal, I was just hoping for some possible clarification on scenarios like this where I get caught in a logic loop.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:15:40.507Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
