        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Yes, but it could be argued that the mission&#39;s phase event triggers before the frigate&#39;s because it is an event and not a static status, more so because I had just read a forum discussion that said players choose the order the events occur in. I had adjusted my game board before noting the frigate ability and then had to undo it. Not a big deal, I was just hoping for some possible clarification on scenarios like this where I get caught in a logic loop.</p>",
